fu?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118478310082764800/LOME6Wfu?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 73, "status": 200, "title": "Mafia Game Rules, Roles & Host App | Mafia Nights", "unwound_url": "https://mafia.elen.red", "url": "https://t.co/SomaIMWEJ7"}]}, "id": "2118478305968140630", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118449808402681911", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dwarkesh_sp And if you want to play with friends and no AI, you can use https://t.co/SomaIMWEJ7 to host your Mafia / Werewolf evening. \n\nP.S. Try to add Jester to your village, throw some chaos and fun!", "url": "https://x.com/snejink/status/2118478305968140630"}, {"author_id": "1674900409700212736", "conversation_id": "2118449808402681911", "created_at": "2026-11-05T22:58:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118477973535772787"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 12, "id": "1209960539390201864", "start": 0, "username": "dwarkesh_sp"}]}, "id": "2118477973535772787", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 34, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118449808402681911", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dwarkesh_sp I do think such a metric will \"saturate\", namely when the LLMs are so smart that they mostly take the best available actions, taking into account their credences for all the unknowns.\nOnce they are all great, the variance will go down. It's not like there's infinite actions here.", "url": "https://x.com/subcountability/status/2118477973535772787"}, {"author_id": "1295550782498979840", "conversation_id": "2118449808402681911", "created_at": "2026-11-05T22:55:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118477360169460047"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 12, "id": "1209960539390201864", "start